
<!-- 5. Components -->
<section class="ss-sec" id="components" aria-labelledby="h-components">
  <header class="pm-section-head pm-section-head--page ss-head"><h2 id="h-components">Components, every state</h2><span class="pm-meta">SPEC D</span></header>
  <div class="ss-body">
    <p class="ss-lede">Every sample below is the shipped markup and CSS, not a picture. Use the theme and density controls at the top to re-render all of them. Thread samples use the inert look <span class="pm-mono">.pm-btn--thread-demo</span>, so this page never carries a real thread.</p>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-buttons" aria-labelledby="h-c-buttons">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-buttons">Thread action and buttons</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.1</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">The thread is the next decision. Buttons name their consequence.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Thread: default, hover, focus, active, disabled with reason, loading, 40px</span>
          <div class="ss-row">
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button">Approve the plan <svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo is-hover" type="button">Hover</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo is-focus" type="button">Focus</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo is-active" type="button">Active</button>
            <span class="ss-row"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="c-r1">Accept sprint 1</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-r1">Answer all 5 to accept.</span></span>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button" aria-busy="true"><span class="pm-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>Approving…</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo pm-btn--lg" type="button">Approve the plan and start building</button>
          </div></div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Ink, quiet, ghost, danger: default and hover</span>
          <div class="ss-row">
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ink" type="button">New project</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ink is-hover" type="button">Hover</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Take a copy</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet is-hover" type="button">Hover</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost" type="button">History</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost is-hover" type="button">Hover</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--danger" type="button">Stop the sprint</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--danger is-hover" type="button">Hover</button>
          </div></div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Quiet: focus, active, disabled, loading. Sizes 40, 36, 32. Icon buttons.</span>
          <div class="ss-row">
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet is-focus" type="button">Focus</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet is-active" type="button">Active</button>
            <span class="ss-row"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="c-r2">Save name</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-r2">Nothing changed yet.</span></span>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" aria-busy="true"><span class="pm-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>Saving…</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--lg" type="button">Large 40</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Default 36</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Small 32</button>
            <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--icon" type="button" aria-label="Clear"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></button>
          </div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Label in the Label step (weight 600 on the thread), optional 16px arrow. The thread has a 1px ink border and ink text. Heights 36, 40 (gate, composer) and 32 (row actions).</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-cmp-button-thread-bg, -thread-fg, -thread-border, -ink-bg, -quiet-border, -h, -radius</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Real button or link with a verb-phrase label. Disabled uses <span class="pm-mono">aria-disabled</span> so it stays focusable and points at its reason with <span class="pm-mono">aria-describedby</span>. Loading sets <span class="pm-mono">aria-busy</span>.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button" style="justify-self:start">Approve the plan and start building</button><span class="ss-cap">Names the consequence.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg pm-t-label">Confirm, Submit, Reject</span><span class="ss-cap">Also: a second canary element, a disabled button with no reason, an icon-only primary.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-actionbar" aria-labelledby="h-c-actionbar">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-actionbar">Action bar</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.1</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">A sticky row at the top of a scrolling column: a status pin and sentence on the left, the decision on the right.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="pm-actionbar"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Draft 1. Nobody has accepted it yet.</span></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Ask for changes (1)</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button">Accept this draft <svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></button></div></div>
        <div class="pm-actionbar"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Accepted by you Tuesday 14:10.</span></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Ask for a new draft</button></div></div>
        <div class="pm-actionbar"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="locked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-lock"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Locked</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Read only while sprint 1 is being built.</span></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Request a revision</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>52px, raised, bottom hairline. Pin and sentence left. Quiet action then the thread right. On the reader it sticks inside the reading scroller.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-z-action-bar, --pm-sys-surface-raised, --pm-hairline</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd><span class="pm-mono">role="region" aria-label="Your decision"</span>. Loading announces through a polite live region.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Needs you. Draft 1. Nobody has accepted it yet.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Put Accept at the bottom of a 3,000 word draft.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-rail" aria-labelledby="h-c-rail">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-rail">Rail item</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.2</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">Eight destinations, each 36px. The active one wears the chalk pen circle. Toggle the sidebar on the left to see the 64px icon-only version.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="ss-row ss-row--top">
          <div class="ss-inkbox" role="group" aria-label="Rail item samples">
            <a class="pm-rail-item" href="#c-rail"><svg class="pm-i"><use href="#i-overview"/></svg><span class="pm-rail-label">Overview</span></a>
            <a class="pm-rail-item" href="#c-rail" aria-current="page"><svg class="pm-i"><use href="#i-documents"/></svg><span class="pm-rail-label">Documents<svg class="pm-pen" viewBox="0 0 100 32" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="50" cy="16" rx="49" ry="15" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/></svg></span><span class="pm-rail-meta pm-tnum">3/3</span></a>
            <a class="pm-rail-item" href="#c-rail" data-locked><svg class="pm-i"><use href="#i-try-it"/></svg><span class="pm-rail-label">Try it</span><svg class="pm-i pm-rail-lock" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg></a>
          </div>
          <p class="ss-cap" style="max-width:36ch">Default, active with pen circle and meta count, and locked (dimmed with a lock, still a link to its locked state). Hover shows a lifted ink row: point at one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>20px icon, Label text, trailing meta. Active: pen circle plus <span class="pm-mono">aria-current="page"</span>, text weight 600. Locked: text muted, 14px lock. Collapsed: 36px icon tile with a tooltip.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-sys-surface-rail, -rail-active, --pm-sys-text-on-rail, -on-rail-muted, --pm-sys-chalk-on-rail</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Arrow keys move between destinations (roving tabindex). <span class="pm-mono">[</span> toggles the rail. Meta counts are a tabular "n of m" block.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Keep Live logs after a 12px gap, with the hidden word "Development" for screen readers.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Add a text row that says "Current project".</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-tape" aria-labelledby="h-c-tape">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-tape">Journey tape</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.3</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">A measure, not a stepper. Every reachable step is a link. The pin sits on the project's real stage, not on the route you happen to be viewing.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="ss-grid2">
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Interview, 2 of about 6 topics</span><div class="ss-tape" data-tape="current:2/6,upcoming,upcoming,upcoming,locked"></div></div>
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Documents, 2 of 3 accepted</span><div class="ss-tape" data-tape="done,current:2/3,upcoming,upcoming,locked"></div></div>
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Build, Try it still locked</span><div class="ss-tape" data-tape="done,done,done,current:1/3,locked"></div></div>
          <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Try it, everything before it done</span><div class="ss-tape" data-tape="done,done,done,done,current"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Five steps on a stitched baseline: a 2px tick, a number (a check when done, a lock when locked), a label and three minor ticks. A 10px pin with a 1px shank marks you-are-here and slides in 240ms when the stage changes. Sub-progress draws n of m ticks.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-cmp-tape-tick, -tape-pin, -tape-done, --pm-tape-w, --pm-tape-w-max</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>An ordered list with <span class="pm-mono">aria-current="step"</span>. Names read like "Step 2, Documents, 2 of 3 accepted. You are here". A locked step is a span with <span class="pm-mono">aria-disabled</span>, never a link.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Pin Build and show Documents done, even when the founder opens the Interview screen.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Read the current step from the URL, or colour the tape with the thread.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-crumb" aria-labelledby="h-c-crumb">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-crumb">Breadcrumb and Back</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.4</span></div>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="ss-row"><a class="pm-back" href="#c-crumb" aria-label="Back to Projects"><svg class="pm-i"><use href="#i-back"/></svg></a><nav class="pm-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb, three levels"><ol><li><a href="#c-crumb">Projects</a></li><li><a href="#c-crumb">todo</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Documents</span></li></ol></nav></div>
        <div class="ss-row"><a class="pm-back" href="#c-crumb" aria-label="Back to Documents"><svg class="pm-i"><use href="#i-back"/></svg></a><nav class="pm-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb, four levels"><ol><li><a href="#c-crumb">Projects</a></li><li><a href="#c-crumb">ui test</a></li><li><a href="#c-crumb">Documents</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Product brief</span></li></ol></nav></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Back is a 32px ghost icon that goes to the parent level, never browser history. Every ancestor is a link, the leaf is weight 600 and never a link. Names truncate at 24 characters.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-sys-text-muted, --pm-sys-hairline (separator)</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>A labelled nav with an ordered list. The Back label names its target: "Back to Documents".</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Projects / ui test / Documents / Product brief, three links and a leaf.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A breadcrumb that stops at the project name, or a Back that acts like the browser button.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-pin" aria-labelledby="h-c-pin">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-pin">Status pin</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.5</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">One vocabulary for projects, documents, sprints, features and jobs. The full list with its sentences is in <a href="#status">Status words</a>.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Tint chips for board cells and callouts, and the head anatomy (glyph, hollow ring, dashed live ring)</span>
          <div class="ss-row">
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="paused"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-bar"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Paused</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="locked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-lock"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Locked</span></span>
            <span class="pm-pin" data-status="working"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working, not live</span></span>
          </div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>A 10px round head with a glyph (so colour is never alone), the label in Label weight 500, then one plain sentence in Body when it is a real status. Working draws a dashed ring that turns only while <span class="pm-mono">data-live="true"</span>.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-sys-status-{needs-you, working, waiting, done, paused, blocked, locked} and the matching -tint, --pm-cmp-pin-size</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>The glyph is decorative. The label text is the status. The sentence is plain text beside it.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span class="pm-pin" data-status="paused"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-bar"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Paused</span></span><span>Paused because the monthly budget is used up.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Building, In progress, Drafting documents, Plan approved: six words for one thing.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-banner" aria-labelledby="h-c-banner">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-banner">Banner</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.6</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">A tint always means a status. If there is no status there is no tint.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--needs-you"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">Read the product brief.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">Pramaan wrote draft 1 on Tuesday at 20:59. Nothing is built until you accept it.</p><details class="pm-details"><summary>Details</summary><div class="pm-details-body"><span class="pm-mono">pramaan-build/ui-test-52da6713 · product/brief.md · draft 1</span></div></details></div><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-banner-action" type="button">Open Documents</button></div>
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--working"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">Pramaan is building sprint 1.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">1 of 3 features ready. Nothing needed from you.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--paused"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="paused"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-bar"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Paused</span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">The monthly budget is used up.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">Raise it in Settings to continue.</p></div><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-banner-action" type="button">Open Settings</button></div>
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--blocked"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">A check did not pass on sign-up and log-in.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">Pramaan is fixing it. Nothing needed from you.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--done"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">All planned sprints accepted.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">Nothing further is scheduled. Open your product any time.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pm-banner pm-banner--info"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="info"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span></span><div><h4 class="pm-banner-title">Your private workspace is ready.</h4><p class="pm-banner-text">Pramaan keeps every draft and decision here.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Pin, one heading sentence, one supporting sentence, at most one quiet action. Padding 16 by 20, card radius, tint background. Needs you carries a 1px ink line on top, never a side stripe. Engineering facts go under Details.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-sys-status-*-tint, --pm-sys-chalk-tint (info), --pm-radius-card</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Body text on a tint always uses the text colour. Status text on its own tint is one of the checked pairs in the contrast table.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Details: repository pramaan-build/todo-d509a2e9, closed by default.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Show the repo path in the first viewport, or tint a panel that has no status.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-card" aria-labelledby="h-c-card">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-card">Project card</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.7</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">The whole card is the link. It leads with the next sentence, not the description.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="pm-card-grid">
          <a class="pm-card pm-card--project pm-card--decision" href="#c-card"><span class="pm-card-tile" aria-hidden="true">T</span><span class="pm-card-name">test</span><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><svg class="pm-card-pen" viewBox="0 0 100 40" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="49" ry="19"/></svg><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><span class="pm-card-next"><span class="pm-card-next-text">Answer the next interview question.</span><svg class="pm-icon pm-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></span><span class="pm-card-meta">0 of 3 documents accepted · Updated 3 days ago</span></a>
          <a class="pm-card pm-card--project" href="#c-card"><span class="pm-card-tile" aria-hidden="true">T</span><span class="pm-card-name">todo</span><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span></span><span class="pm-card-next"><span class="pm-card-next-text">Pramaan is building sprint 1 of 4 (building). Nothing needed from you.</span><svg class="pm-icon pm-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></span><span class="pm-card-meta">3 of 3 documents accepted · Sprint 1 of 4 · Updated 22 minutes ago</span></a>
          <a class="pm-card pm-card--project is-hover" href="#c-card"><span class="pm-card-tile" aria-hidden="true">T</span><span class="pm-card-name">test first</span><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><span class="pm-card-next"><span class="pm-card-next-text">All 1 planned sprints accepted. Open your product any time.</span><svg class="pm-icon pm-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></span><span class="pm-card-meta">3 of 3 documents accepted · Sprint 1 of 1 · Updated 22 hours ago</span></a>
        </div>
