      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>28px initial tile, name (Heading), pin, next sentence (Body), meta line (Meta). Padding 16, min height 124, two columns (three from 1440). No nested buttons.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-cmp-card-pad, --pm-radius-card, --pm-sys-control-border (hover), --pm-sys-chalk (pen)</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>One link. Focus draws the ring on the card. The count in the list title follows the search: "2 of 9 match 'todo'".</dd></dl>
