    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-reader" aria-labelledby="h-c-reader">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-reader">Reading document</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.10</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">The reading column is the one scroller. The action bar and section headings stick inside it. Click the chalk mark for the comment popover.</p>
      <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--reader">
        <div class="pm-reader" data-state="draft">
          <nav class="pm-toc" aria-label="In this document"><p class="pm-toc-title">In this document</p><ol><li><a href="#c-s-outcome" title="The one thing this product should do." aria-current="location">One-sentence outcome</a></li><li><a href="#c-s-constraints" title="What the product must stay within, and what it will not do.">Constraints and non-goals</a></li><li><a href="#c-s-advanced" title="Pramaan's working rules. Most people never need to open these.">Advanced sections</a><ol><li><a href="#c-s-exec" title="What Pramaan promises to do, and what it will not touch.">Execution contract</a></li></ol></li></ol><div class="pm-toc-links"><a href="#c-s-constraints">Passage comments (1)</a><a href="#c-s-details">Details</a></div></nav>
          <div class="pm-reader-body" tabindex="0" aria-label="Product brief, draft 1">
            <div class="pm-actionbar" role="region" aria-label="Your decision"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Draft 1. Nobody has accepted it yet.</span></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Ask for changes (1)</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button">Accept this draft</button></div></div>
            <div class="pm-reader-doc">
              <div class="pm-byline"><span>Pramaan wrote draft 1 on Tuesday at 20:59.</span><div class="pm-versions" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Version"><button class="pm-chip" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true">Draft 1 · newest</button></div></div>
              <details class="pm-details pm-byline-details" id="c-s-details"><summary>Details</summary><div class="pm-details-body pm-mono">Repository: pramaan-build/ui-test-52da6713<br>File: product/brief.md<br>Version: draft 1</div></details>
              <article class="pm-article">
                <section class="pm-reader-sec"><h2 id="c-s-outcome">One-sentence outcome</h2><p class="pm-gloss">The one thing this product should do.</p><p>For two people sharing a screen, change a tic-tac-toe screen idea to a playable game where X starts, players take turns, the result is shown, and they can start a new game each time they play.</p></section>
                <section class="pm-reader-sec"><h2 id="c-s-constraints">Constraints and non-goals</h2><p class="pm-gloss">What the product must stay within, and what it will not do.</p><ul><li class="pm-has-mark">Constraint: <span class="pm-marked">This is a browser-based web app that works on phones, tablets, and computers</span> and can be added to a phone's home screen.<button class="pm-chalk-mark" type="button" popovertarget="c-pop1" aria-label="Comment 1 on 'Constraint: This is a browser-based web app'">1</button></li><li>Non-goal: playing against the computer.</li></ul></section>
                <details class="pm-details pm-reader-adv" id="c-s-advanced"><summary>Advanced sections (how Pramaan will work)</summary>
                  <section class="pm-reader-sub"><h2 id="c-s-exec">Execution contract</h2><p class="pm-gloss">What Pramaan promises to do, and what it will not touch.</p><ul><li>Mode: <code>supervised</code></li><li>Target environments in order: verification cell, sprint preview</li><li>Required credential references: none; the product needs no outside service</li></ul></section>
                </details>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pm-popover" id="c-pop1" popover data-anchor="invoker" aria-label="Comment 1"><div class="pm-comment"><blockquote class="pm-quote">This is a browser-based web app that works on phones, tablets, and computers</blockquote><span class="pm-comment-by">You, draft 1</span><p class="pm-comment-text">I don't think this is a constraint</p><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button" popovertarget="c-pop1" popovertargetaction="hide">Remove comment</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ss-stage ss-grid3">
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Selection button</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm pm-comment-cta pm-comment-cta--static" type="button">Comment on this passage</button></div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Empty: no draft yet</span><div class="pm-row"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Pramaan is writing draft 1.</span></div><div class="pm-skel-p" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-3)" aria-hidden="true"><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span></div></div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Locked: comments off with a reason</span><p class="pm-reader-note">Comments reopen after the sprint.</p><span class="pm-has-mark" style="display:block;width:150px;margin-top:var(--pm-space-2)"><span class="pm-marked">A commented passage</span><span class="pm-chalk-mark" role="img" aria-label="Comment 1" aria-disabled="true" style="left:calc(100% + 16px)">1</span></span></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Contents rail (200px, current section bolded with a 2px ink bar), a 68ch article, and the chalk margin. Commented passages get a 2px chalk underline and a 24px numbered disc in the margin. Every heading that uses a working term carries a one-line plain gloss under it (<span class="pm-mono">.pm-gloss</span>, meta size, muted), and table headers are plain words with the file's own term in their title. File codes (KPI-1, G-1) and ids sit in a closed Details inside the cell; repo paths sit in the closed Details under the byline. Sections a founder never needs (execution contract, decision policy, authority, readiness) sit in one closed "Advanced sections" group (<span class="pm-mono">details.pm-reader-adv</span> holding <span class="pm-mono">.pm-reader-sub</span>), listed nested in the contents rail; a contents link into it opens it first.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-toc-w, --pm-reading-w, --pm-sys-chalk, -chalk-tint, -chalk-text</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>The column is an article. Marks are buttons named "Comment 1 on 'Constraint: ...'". Version chips are a radio group. Chalk text is only ever on chalk tint or raised. The contents rail marks the current section with <span class="pm-mono">aria-current="location"</span>; a section inside a closed group is never marked.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Keep Accept this draft in the bar that stays under the top bar.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Put chalk text on the sunken grey: that pair is not checked.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-chat" aria-labelledby="h-c-chat">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-chat">Chat workbench</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.11</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">The conversation is the job. One scroll, the composer always in reach, the decisions always visible.</p>
      <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--chat">
        <div class="pm-wb">
          <section class="pm-chat" id="c-chat-run" aria-label="Interview">
            <div class="pm-chat-head"><div><h4 class="pm-t-heading">Your product partner</h4><div class="pm-chat-topics" title="Topics adjust as your scope changes."><span><span class="pm-tnum">2</span> of about <span class="pm-tnum">6</span> topics covered</span><span class="pm-progress"><span class="pm-progress-track"><span class="pm-progress-fill" style="--pm-progress: 33%"></span></span></span></div></div><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button">Add a document</button></div>
            <div class="pm-chat-thread" role="log" aria-live="polite" tabindex="0" aria-label="Conversation"><div class="pm-chat-flow">
              <div class="pm-msg"><div class="pm-msg-head"><span class="pm-msg-who">Pramaan</span><span class="pm-msg-time">14:03</span></div><div class="pm-msg-body"><p>Thanks. I have saved the product idea. Who plays, and where?</p></div></div>
              <form class="pm-qcard" aria-labelledby="c-qc-title" onsubmit="return false"><div class="pm-qcard-body"><h4 class="pm-qcard-title pm-t-heading" id="c-qc-title">Two quick questions</h4>
                <fieldset class="pm-qfield"><legend>Who plays?</legend><label class="pm-qopt"><input type="radio" name="c-q1" checked> Two people on the same screen</label><label class="pm-qopt"><input type="radio" name="c-q1"> Two people on different devices</label><label class="pm-qopt"><input type="radio" name="c-q1"> One person against the computer</label></fieldset>
                <fieldset class="pm-qfield"><legend>What happens when someone wins?</legend><input class="pm-input" type="text" aria-label="What happens when someone wins?"></fieldset></div>
                <div class="pm-qcard-foot"><span>Your answers are saved as decisions.</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="submit">Submit answers</button></div></form>
            </div></div>
            <form class="pm-composer" aria-label="Reply"><div class="pm-composer-row"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--icon pm-btn--lg" type="button" aria-label="Attach files or images"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-attach"/></svg></button><textarea class="pm-composer-input" rows="1" placeholder="Tell us in your own words" aria-label="Your reply"></textarea><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--lg" type="submit">Send reply</button></div><div class="pm-composer-hint"><span>Ctrl+Enter sends. Your decisions save as you go.</span></div></form>
          </section>
          <aside class="pm-decisions" aria-label="Your decisions"><div class="pm-decisions-head"><h4 class="pm-t-heading">Your decisions</h4><span class="pm-decisions-count"><span class="pm-tnum">1</span> of about <span class="pm-tnum">6</span> saved</span><span class="pm-progress pm-progress--line"><span class="pm-progress-track"><span class="pm-progress-fill" style="--pm-progress: 16%"></span></span></span></div>
            <ul class="pm-decisions-list"><li class="pm-decision"><button class="pm-decision-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="pm-decision-title">Product idea</span><span class="pm-decision-value">a tic tac toe game</span><span class="pm-decision-editcue">Edit</span></button><div class="pm-decision-editor" hidden><textarea class="pm-textarea" aria-label="Product idea"></textarea><div class="pm-decision-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-decision-save>Save</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-decision-cancel>Cancel</button></div></div></li></ul>
            <div class="pm-decisions-foot">Saved automatically. Edit any decision any time.</div></aside>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ss-stage ss-grid2">
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Interview finished: the send button drops to quiet, the thread moves to the top bar</span><div class="pm-chat-done" style="margin-top:0;border-top:0;padding-top:0"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">We have a direction. Your brief uses your latest saved decisions.</span></div><div class="ss-row" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-3)"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--lg" type="button">Send reply</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo pm-btn--lg" type="button">Create my product brief</button></div></div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Streaming, send disabled with its reason, and the new-reply pill</span><div class="pm-msg"><div class="pm-msg-head"><span class="pm-msg-who">Pramaan</span><span class="pm-msg-time">14:05</span></div><div class="pm-msg-stream" aria-live="polite"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Pramaan is replying…</span></span></div></div><div class="ss-row" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-3)"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo pm-btn--lg" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-busy="true" aria-describedby="c-send-why">Sending…</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-send-why">Pramaan is replying…</span></div><button class="pm-newreply" type="button" style="position:static;margin:var(--pm-space-3) 0 0">New reply below</button></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>A thread column (Pramaan as plain text, your messages on the sunken surface), a question card as the last item with its own Submit, a docked composer, and a 320px decisions panel of 46px collapsed rows. Details (workspace size, repo) sit at the very bottom.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-panel-w, --pm-cmp-work-h, --pm-row-h, --pm-radius-card</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>The thread is <span class="pm-mono">role="log"</span> with a polite live region. Ctrl+Enter sends. Escape cancels an inline decision edit. Auto-scroll only when you are near the bottom.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Send reply, with the hint "Ctrl+Enter sends. Your decisions save as you go."</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Let the reply box drop below two scrolls, or grow the decisions list without a limit.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-route" aria-labelledby="h-c-route">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-route">Sprint route</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.12</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">A stitched route instead of chips and arrows: what each sprint delivers, what you can try, and what happens after it. Switch on Show my words in the third move to see the chalk quotes.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <ol class="pm-route" aria-label="Your plan while building">
          <li class="pm-route-node" data-status="done"><span class="pm-route-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="pm-icon pm-route-glyph"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><div class="pm-route-card"><div class="pm-route-title"><h4>Sprint 1 · Your private checklist</h4><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Accepted by you Tuesday.</span></span></div><p class="pm-route-try"><strong>You can try:</strong> sign up, log in, land on your own empty checklist, and add your own tasks to it.</p><a class="pm-route-open" href="#c-route">Open what was built</a></div></li>
          <li class="pm-route-node" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-route-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="pm-route-card"><div class="pm-route-title"><h4>Sprint 2 · Keep your list</h4><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Pramaan is building it. Nothing needed from you.</span></span></div><p class="pm-route-label">You will be able to:</p><ul class="pm-route-outcomes"><li>Rename a task and see the new name in the same place<span class="pm-said">You said: 'add, rename, delete, and check off tasks' <a class="pm-said-edit" href="#c-route">Edit that decision</a></span></li><li>Check a task and see it marked as done</li><li>Delete a task, confirming first, and see only that task disappear</li></ul><p class="pm-route-then">Then: try sprint 2, share what you found, accept it. Sprint 3 starts when you accept.</p></div></li>
          <li class="pm-route-node" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-route-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="pm-route-card"><div class="pm-route-title"><h4>Sprint 3 · Fresh checks every day</h4><span class="pm-pin" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Starts after sprint 2 is accepted.</span></span></div></div></li>
          <li class="pm-route-end"><p>After sprint 4, all planned sprints are accepted. You can open your product any time and plan more.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Plan being drafted: three skeleton nodes; Approve is shown disabled with its reason (screen 11b)</span><div class="pm-row" style="margin-bottom:var(--pm-space-3)"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Pramaan is drafting your plan from the three accepted documents.</span></span></div>
          <ol class="pm-route pm-route--drafting" aria-hidden="true"><li class="pm-route-node" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-route-dot"></span><div class="pm-route-card"><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span></div></li><li class="pm-route-node" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-route-dot"></span><div class="pm-route-card"><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span></div></li></ol></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>A vertical 2px stitched line with a 24px stage node per sprint (status colour and glyph). The card lists outcomes with hollow ticks, a chalk "You can try" block and a Meta "Then" line. The route ends with a terminal node.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-stitch, --pm-sys-status-*, --pm-sys-chalk-tint, --pm-radius-card</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>An ordered list. Node status is stated by the pin label, not colour alone.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Then: try sprint 1, share what you found, accept it. Sprint 2 starts when you accept.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Six wrapping chips joined by arrows, and no next step.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-board" aria-labelledby="h-c-board">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-board">Feature board</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.13</span></div>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div class="pm-board-layout">
          <div>
            <div class="pm-sprint-head"><div class="pm-sprint-head-top"><h4 class="pm-t-heading">Sprint 1 · Your private checklist</h4><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">1 of 3 features ready. Nothing needed from you.</span></span></div><div class="pm-sprint-progress"><span class="pm-sprint-digits">1 of 3</span><span class="pm-sprint-unit">features ready</span></div><div class="pm-progress pm-progress--wide"><span class="pm-progress-track"><span class="pm-progress-fill" style="--pm-progress: 33%"></span></span></div></div>
            <table class="pm-table pm-board ss-flat" data-density="compact"><colgroup><col style="width:36%"><col style="width:13%"><col style="width:13%"><col style="width:13%"><col style="width:13%"><col style="width:12%"></colgroup><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Building</th><th scope="col">Testing</th><th scope="col">Reviewing</th><th scope="col">Ready</th><th scope="col"><span class="pm-sr">Details</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
              <tr><td><span class="pm-board-name">Sign-up and log-in</span><span class="pm-board-sentence">You can create an account with your email and password, log back in later, and see a clear error if the password is wrong.</span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span></td><td><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button" data-toggle-target="c-board-d1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="c-board-d1">Details</button></td></tr>
              <tr class="pm-board-detail" id="c-board-d1" hidden><td colspan="6"><pre class="pm-board-raw">Fixer: Good. Now let's run the new page tests to check for issues. · 1m ago</pre></td></tr>
              <tr><td><span class="pm-board-name">Your own checklist</span><span class="pm-board-sentence">Starts when Sign-up and log-in is ready.</span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span></td><td><span class="pm-pin pm-pin--tint" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span></td><td></td></tr>
            </tbody></table>
            <div class="pm-activity" style="margin-top:var(--pm-space-5)"><h4 class="pm-t-heading">Happening in your sprint</h4><ol><li><span>Testing sign-up and log-in</span><span class="pm-activity-time">1 minute ago</span></li><li><span>Built sign-up and log-in</span><span class="pm-activity-time">4 minutes ago</span></li><li><span>Sprint 1 started</span><span class="pm-activity-time">12 minutes ago</span></li></ol></div>
          </div>
          <aside class="pm-thissprint" aria-label="This sprint"><p class="pm-route-label" style="margin-top:0">When this sprint is done you can:</p><ul class="pm-ticks"><li>Sign up with an email and password</li><li>Log in and land on your own empty checklist</li><li>Add your own tasks, each one going to the bottom of the list</li></ul><p class="pm-route-then">Then: Try sprint 1 appears here and in the top bar.</p></aside>
        </div>
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">No activity yet</span><div class="pm-activity"><p class="pm-activity-empty">Nothing has happened yet. The first entry appears when building starts.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Feature by stage grid at compact density. Cells are tinted pin chips (Waiting has no tint). Progress is features ready over features planned, never a percentage, so 95% and 3 of 3 can never disagree. Worker notes live under Details.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-cmp-board-digits-size, --pm-sys-status-*-tint, [data-density="compact"]</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>A real table. Each cell says its status in words. Details is a button that controls its row.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>1 of 3 features ready.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A 95% bar next to 3 of 3, or a worker's raw note in the row.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-gate" aria-labelledby="h-c-gate">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-gate">Approval gate</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.14</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">Navigation alone must never start a build. The gate asks in words first.</p>
      <div class="ss-stage">
        <div><span class="ss-cap ss-cap--block">Asking for changes opens a region under the bar, not a dialog</span>
          <div class="pm-actionbar pm-actionbar--gate pm-gate" role="region" aria-label="Your decision"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><p class="pm-actionbar-question">Approve this plan?</p></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" aria-expanded="true">Ask for changes to the plan</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo pm-btn--lg" type="button">Approve the plan and start building <svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-arrow-right"/></svg></button></div><p class="pm-actionbar-consequence pm-gate-sentence">4 sprints. Sprint 1 builds your private checklist. Nothing is built until you approve, and you can ask for changes first.</p></div>
          <div class="pm-gate-changes"><label class="pm-label" for="c-gate-text">What should change in the plan?</label><textarea class="pm-textarea" id="c-gate-text"></textarea><div class="pm-gate-changes-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Send changes</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button">Cancel</button></div></div></div>
        <div class="pm-actionbar pm-actionbar--gate pm-gate" role="region" aria-label="Your decision, approved"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="done"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Done</span></span><p class="pm-actionbar-question">Plan approved Tuesday 14:10.</p></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Ask for a change to the plan</button></div><p class="pm-actionbar-consequence pm-gate-sentence">Sprint 1 is being built. A change creates a revision after the current sprint.</p></div>
        <div class="pm-actionbar pm-actionbar--gate pm-gate" role="region" aria-label="Your decision, disabled"><div class="pm-actionbar-main"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="needs-you"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Needs you</span></span><p class="pm-actionbar-question">Approve this plan?</p></div><div class="pm-actionbar-actions"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button">Ask for changes to the plan</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo pm-btn--lg" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="c-gate-why">Approve the plan and start building</button></div><p class="pm-gate-reason" id="c-gate-why">Raise the monthly budget in Settings to approve. <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Open Settings</button></p></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>A 64px action bar: pin, question, consequence sentence, quiet "Ask for changes", the 40px thread. While the bar is on screen it holds the thread and the top-bar copy is hidden. When it scrolls away the top-bar copy takes over, so there is always exactly one.</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-z-action-bar, --pm-cmp-button-h (40px)</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>A labelled region. A disabled approve states its reason and a way out.</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Nothing is built until you approve, and you can ask for changes first.</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">Start a build because someone opened the Roadmap.</span></div></div>
    </article>

    <article class="ss-comp" id="c-stage" aria-labelledby="h-c-stage">
      <div class="ss-comp-head"><h3 id="h-c-stage">Preview stage and checklist</h3><span class="pm-meta">D.15</span></div>
      <p class="ss-lede">The preview is the hero and the checklist is a fixed side panel. Try the verdict buttons: the count, the thread label and its reason change with your answers.</p>
      <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--try">
        <div class="pm-wb">
          <section class="pm-stage" aria-label="Private preview"><div class="pm-stage-bar"><span>Private preview · Sprint 1: Calculator on every device</span><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--ghost pm-btn--sm" type="button">Open in a new tab <svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-i-external"/></svg></button></div><div class="pm-stage-body"><iframe title="Calculator preview, sprint 1" srcdoc="&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;meta charset='utf-8'&gt;&lt;body style='font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;margin:24px;max-width:420px'&gt;&lt;h2 style='font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px'&gt;Calculator&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;label for='c'&gt;Current calculation&lt;/label&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;input id='c' style='width:100%;padding:8px;margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box'&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;button style='padding:8px 16px;font-size:16px'&gt;Calculate&lt;/button&gt;&lt;p&gt;Result: &lt;/p&gt;"></iframe></div></section>
          <aside class="pm-checklist" aria-label="Try these"><div class="pm-checklist-head"><h4 class="pm-t-heading">Try these</h4><span class="pm-checklist-count pm-tnum">2 of 3 answered</span><span class="pm-progress pm-progress--line"><span class="pm-progress-track"><span class="pm-progress-fill" style="--pm-progress: 66%"></span></span></span></div>
            <ol class="pm-checklist-items">
              <li class="pm-check" data-verdict="yes"><p class="pm-check-task">Enter 1 + 2 and press Calculate.</p><p class="pm-check-expected">You see 3.</p><div class="pm-verdicts" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Did it work? Enter 1 + 2 and press Calculate."><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-value="yes">Yes</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="not-quite">Not quite</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="confusing">Confusing</button></div><div class="pm-verdict-note" hidden><textarea class="pm-textarea" rows="1" aria-label="What happened?" placeholder="What happened?"></textarea></div></li>
              <li class="pm-check" data-verdict="not-quite"><p class="pm-check-task">Enter 2 + 3 × 4 and press Calculate.</p><p class="pm-check-expected">You see 14.</p><span class="pm-said">You said: 'just simple mathematical functions' <a class="pm-said-edit" href="#c-stage">Edit that decision</a></span><div class="pm-verdicts" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Did it work? Enter 2 + 3 × 4 and press Calculate."><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="yes">Yes</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-value="not-quite">Not quite</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="confusing">Confusing</button></div><div class="pm-verdict-note"><textarea class="pm-textarea" rows="1" aria-label="What happened?" placeholder="What happened?">I saw 20</textarea></div></li>
              <li class="pm-check" data-verdict=""><p class="pm-check-task">Enter 1 ÷ 0 and press Calculate.</p><p class="pm-check-expected">You see the exact message you asked for.</p><div class="pm-verdicts" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Did it work? Enter 1 ÷ 0 and press Calculate."><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" data-value="yes">Yes</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="not-quite">Not quite</button><button class="pm-verdict" type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" data-value="confusing">Confusing</button></div><div class="pm-verdict-note" hidden><textarea class="pm-textarea" rows="1" aria-label="What happened?" placeholder="What happened?"></textarea></div></li>
            </ol>
            <div class="pm-checklist-foot"><p data-check-sentence>Your notes go to Pramaan as the next fix.</p><div class="pm-checklist-foot-row"><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--thread-demo" type="button" data-check-thread aria-describedby="c-chk-reason">Ask for changes (1)</button><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet" type="button" data-check-anyway>Accept anyway</button><span class="pm-btn-reason" id="c-chk-reason" data-check-reason hidden></span></div></div></aside>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ss-stage ss-grid3">
        <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--small"><section class="pm-stage" aria-label="Preview loading"><div class="pm-stage-bar"><span>Private preview</span></div><div class="pm-stage-body"><div class="pm-stage-state"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="working" data-live="true"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Working</span><span class="pm-pin-sentence">Loading your preview…</span></span><span class="pm-skeleton"></span></div></div></section></div>
        <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--small"><section class="pm-stage" aria-label="Preview error"><div class="pm-stage-bar"><span>Private preview</span></div><div class="pm-stage-body"><div class="pm-stage-state"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="blocked"><span class="pm-pin-head"><svg class="pm-pin-glyph" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Blocked</span></span><p>The preview did not load. Try again, or open it in a new tab.</p><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Try again</button></div></div></section></div>
        <div class="ss-frame ss-frame--small"><section class="pm-stage" aria-label="Preview waiting"><div class="pm-stage-bar"><span>Private preview</span></div><div class="pm-stage-body"><div class="pm-stage-state"><span class="pm-pin" data-status="waiting"><span class="pm-pin-head"></span><span class="pm-pin-label">Waiting</span></span><p>Your preview appears here when sprint 1 is ready.</p><button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button">Open Build</button></div></div></section></div>
      </div>
      <dl class="ss-notes"><dt>Anatomy</dt><dd>Stage on the left at viewport height with a bar ("Private preview · Sprint 1: ...") and the iframe filling the row. The panel is 320px: a header with "n of m answered", 2-line items with Yes, Not quite, Confusing (28px toggles), and a docked footer with the thread. Not quite and Confusing reveal "What happened?".</dd><dt>Tokens</dt><dd class="pm-mono">--pm-panel-w, --pm-cmp-verdict-h, --pm-sys-text (chosen verdict fill)</dd><dt>A11y</dt><dd>Each verdict group is a radio group (arrows and the keys 1, 2, 3). The disabled accept states "Answer all 5 to accept."</dd></dl>
      <div class="ss-dd"><div class="ss-do"><span class="ss-do-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-check"/></svg>Do</span><span>Ask for changes (2), with "Your notes go to Pramaan as the next fix."</span></div><div class="ss-dont"><span class="ss-dont-label"><svg class="pm-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#pm-g-x"/></svg>Don't</span><span class="ss-eg">A 571px preview box under a page-long checklist.</span></div></div>
    </article>
<!--P4-->
  </div>
</section>
